{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レッスン後の1人遊び"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN102MTRQ8Q36X6NH67SPVX","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN1041ZRGY2WPEWPB00ZDKK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN105RBH55RVXW3ZDGSBFR7","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN106WQ8EM0WSDB3MM65N6P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は図書館で本を読んでいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は小さい頃から\n全く本を読んでこなかったので\n本を読むのがとても遅いです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別に本を読まなくたって\n生きていけるしと思っていたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本は沢山の知識を得ることが出来るし\nそれによって自分の世界が広がります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今となっては\nあの時からずっと読んでおけば\n良かったなぁと少し後悔しています"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもまあずっと本を読んでいたら\nこのような人間にはなっていなかった\nと思うのでこれはこれでいいか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校の朝読書の時間は\nチャイムが鳴ったら本を適当に開いて\n腕を乗っけて本を読む振りをして\n朝読書の時間が終わるまで寝ていました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは機会があったら図書館に行って積極的に本を読もうと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"}